# 04-RemoveAndPurge.versionmanagers for the 'version-managers' profile
#
# mise subsumes both asdf and direnv, so this profile removes them in the
# same change that installs mise. Running asdf and mise side by side is the
# classic failure mode (both provide shims for the same tools), so the
# cutover is hard rather than staged.
#
# Removing the binaries does NOT touch the data they left behind:
# `~/.asdf/`, `~/.tool-versions`, `~/.config/direnv/lib/use_asdf.sh`, and
# every repo's `.envrc` / `.tool-versions` all survive. `make asdf-to-mise`
# warns about each of them; you decide when to delete them.

